# Tunnel ceiling cell with a lamp (decorative, non-solid): the
# tunnel_bg ceiling look plus a small m housing with a Y light and an
# o glow. Not autotiled (one look: the ceiling row). The level puts
# one every 4 tiles in the tunnel's ceiling row instead of tunnel_bg.
sprite = tile_tunnel_bg_lamp
size   = 16x16
origin = 0,0
anim   = idle frames=1
---
frame idle 0
dddddddddddddddd
dddddddddddddddd
dddddddddddddddd
mmmmmmmmmmmmmmmm
mdddddmmmmdddddm
mdddddYYYYdddddd
mddddddooddddddd
dmdddddddddddddd
dddddddddddddddd
dddddddddddddddd
dddddddddddddddd
dddddddddddddddd
dddddddddddddddd
dddddddddddddddd
dddddddddddddddd
dddddddddddddddd
